---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const profileSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ProfilePage',
  '@id': 'https://emonhossain.pro/about#profile',
  url: 'https://emonhossain.pro/about',
  name: 'About Emon Hossain',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Person',
    '@id': 'https://emonhossain.pro/#emon-hossain',
    name: 'Emon Hossain',
    url: 'https://emonhossain.pro/',
    jobTitle: 'AI Systems Strategist & Automation Builder',
    description: 'Bangladesh-based AI systems strategist and automation builder focused on practical AI systems, workflow automation, business operations and AI adoption.',
    homeLocation: {
      '@type': 'Place',
      name: 'Dhaka, Bangladesh'
    },
    knowsAbout: [
      'Applied AI',
      'AI systems',
      'Workflow automation',
      'Business operations',
      'AI adoption',
      'Notion systems',
      'Technical SEO'
    ],
    sameAs: [
      'https://www.youtube.com/@emonhossain_pro',
      'https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4260-2160'
    ]
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Emon Hossain | AI Systems Strategist & Automation Builder"
  description="Emon Hossain is a Bangladesh-based AI systems strategist and automation builder focused on practical AI systems, workflow automation, business operations and AI adoption."
  ogTitle="About Emon Hossain — AI Systems Strategist & Automation Builder"
  schema={profileSchema}
>
  <div class="container" style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;max-width:52rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">ABOUT EMON HOSSAIN</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.15;">I build AI systems, test what works, and explain how to use AI in the real world.</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:1.5rem;line-height:1.75;">
      I’m an AI systems strategist and automation builder based in Bangladesh. My work sits at the intersection of applied AI, workflow design, business operations and practical AI adoption.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top:4rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3.5rem;">
      <section>
        <div class="eyebrow">THE ARC</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:.5rem;">From demand to operations to systems.</h2>
        <div style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.85;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;">
          <p>My earlier work in digital marketing and SEO taught me how people discover, evaluate and buy. Operating businesses then made a different problem impossible to ignore: growth is often constrained by repetitive work, fragmented information and processes that depend on someone remembering the next step.</p>
          <p>That pushed my work toward operating systems, workflow automation and eventually applied AI. I use AI where judgment, language or interpretation helps, and deterministic automation where consistency matters more than novelty.</p>
          <p>I also study the wider AI adoption problem in Bangladesh and other emerging-market contexts. That research is kept distinct from commercial work so evidence, incentives and affiliations remain clear.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="eyebrow">HOW I WORK</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:.5rem;">Proof before hype.</h2>
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">SYSTEMS FIRST</div>
            <h3>Start with the process</h3>
            <p>Map the work, the owner, the handoffs, the failure modes and the definition of done before choosing a tool.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">EVIDENCE FIRST</div>
            <h3>Show what can be checked</h3>
            <p>Results, ratings, customer counts and performance numbers belong in public only when the supporting evidence is current and correctly scoped.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">HUMAN CONTROL</div>
            <h3>Automate with boundaries</h3>
            <p>AI can assist reasoning and execution, but consequential actions still need clear permissions, review points and traceability.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">BANGLADESH → GLOBAL</div>
            <h3>Grounded locally, useful broadly</h3>
            <p>I care about local constraints such as language, small teams and uneven digital infrastructure without positioning Bangladesh as a low-end market.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:.5rem;">What I work with.</h2>
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">SYSTEM DESIGN</div>
            <h3>Workflows & operating systems</h3>
            <p>Notion-based systems, process mapping, SOP architecture, information structure and operational handoffs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">AUTOMATION</div>
            <h3>Low-code workflow orchestration</h3>
            <p>Tools such as n8n, Make and Zapier, selected according to the workflow rather than treated as the product.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">APPLIED AI</div>
            <h3>LLM-assisted workflows</h3>
            <p>Prompt/workflow design, AI tool integration, model-assisted drafting, analysis and agent-style orchestration with human review where needed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="entity-card">
            <div class="role">WEB & DISCOVERY</div>
            <h3>Web tooling, SEO & prototyping</h3>
            <p>Technical SEO, website systems, AI-assisted web prototyping and light scripting/integration work when it supports the larger system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="eyebrow">ROLES</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:.5rem;">Different contexts, one person.</h2>
        <div style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.85;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;">
          <p>For commercial AI systems and automation work, I operate through the appropriate business context, including SYSmoAI where relevant. Scope, delivery and pricing are confirmed for the actual engagement rather than inferred from old public packages.</p>
          <p>For academic submissions, my affiliation is <strong>Independent Researcher, Dhaka, Bangladesh</strong>. BangladeshAI.Org is a research/public-interest surface and is not used as my formal academic institutional affiliation.</p>
          <p>For creator and education work, I focus on making AI systems, tools and opportunities easier to understand for Bangla- and English-speaking audiences.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="padding:2rem;background:white;border:1px solid var(--brand-stone-200);border-radius:1rem;">
        <div class="eyebrow">NEXT</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:.5rem;">Explore the work, not just the bio.</h2>
        <div class="hero-cta" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
          <a href="/writing" class="btn-primary">Read My Writing</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-outline">Contact Me</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
